B.cbr=new A.eE("TR Jet (PAPSp)","Apical","Apical \u2014 RV focused, slight tilt toward left shoulder. PSAX alternate",B.buN,"CWD cursor on TV annulus/jet exit point. Record multiple cycles. PAPSp = 4 \xd7 V\xb2","Should see vertically placed heart in apical view. View RA, TV, and RV in PSAX",B.bnn,"Always check TR jet in both apical and PSAX views. Jet velocity can be falsely reduced in significant RV dysfunction","Jain A, McNamara PJ. Semin Fetal Neonatal Med. 2015. ASE TNE Guidelines 2024")
B.bkL=s(["Apical 4-chamber view, LV focused","Add colour Doppler to visualise mitral inflow","PWD gate between MV annulus and tips \u2014 just inside LV","Freeze a short clip, move frame by frame in diastole","Confirm gate is NOT above or below annulus and tips","PWD gate should be more toward interventricular septal wall","Measure E wave (passive filling) and A wave (atrial contraction)","E/A = E peak velocity \xf7 A peak velocity"],t.s)
