B.cbH=new A.eE("E/A Ratio","Apical","Same as EF; LV focused, slight tilt toward right shoulder",B.bkL,"PWD in four-chamber. Sample gate between MV annulus and tips, just inside LV","Gate not above or below annulus and tips. Move frame by frame to confirm",B.boz,"E and A waves often merged in sick neonates due to high heart rate. Avoid measuring if waves fused","Mertens L, Friedberg MK. Nat Rev Cardiol. 2010;7:551\u2013563. Tissot et al. Front Pediatr. 2018")
B.bsj=s(["Apical 4-chamber view","Make a 5-chamber view by tilting slightly anterior","Add colour Doppler to visualise both inflow AND outflow jets simultaneously","Place PWD gate inside LV at intersection of both jets","Gate more toward interventricular septal wall","IVRT = time from aortic valve closure to mitral valve opening","Measure from end of ejection signal to start of E wave"],t.s)
B.ccU=new A.cj("Term neonate","35\u201365 ms","Prolonged IVRT suggests impaired relaxation","normal")
B.cdg=new A.cj("Preterm neonate","30\u201360 ms","Values vary with heart rate","normal")
B.cdi=new A.cj("Prolonged IVRT",">70 ms \u2014 diastolic dysfunction","","abnormal")
