B.cbx=new A.eE("Eccentricity Index","Parasternal","1 O'clock, PSAX, apical tilt, papillary muscle cut",B.bmp,"Check IVS position. D2 through IVS midpoint and LV posterior free wall. D1 perpendicular to D2","D2 through IVS midpoint. D1 perpendicular to D2",B.bys,"Newer measure, not much is known about this index as of now","Ryan T, et al. J Am Coll Cardiol. 1996")
B.bqs=s(["PSAX view, 1 O'clock",u.F,"Display RV systole waveform","Calculate RVET: from start to end of the trace waveform","Calculate time to peak velocity: from start of trace to peak","PAAT = time from start of RV ejection to peak pulmonary velocity","IMPORTANT: measure from start to EARLIEST peak, NOT mid-peak","Waveform is more rounded and not wedge-shaped in high PAP"],t.s)
